%%{init: {"sequence": {"wrapPadding": 18}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P as ask/route + agent
  participant BR as Bedrock Converse (Claude Opus)
  participant GD as sql-guard (read-only guard)
  participant RS as Redshift Data API / Athena
  P->>BR: Converse(system = catalog + hard rules, messages = [user: question], toolConfig = [run_sql])
  loop until stopReason ≠ tool_use or maxIters (8) reached
    BR-->>P: stopReason=tool_use, toolUse run_sql{sql}
    P->>GD: sanitizeSelect(sql, maxRows=200)
    alt not read-only / multiple statements / forbidden keyword
      GD-->>P: {ok:false, error}
      P-->>BR: toolResult{error} (the model reads the error and self-corrects)
    else valid
      GD-->>P: SELECT * FROM (sql) LIMIT 200
      P->>RS: execute the read-only SQL
      RS-->>P: columns + rows + rowCount
      P-->>BR: toolResult{columns, rows (≤modelRows=50), row_count}
    end
  end
  BR-->>P: stopReason=end_turn → final answer in Chinese
  Note over P,RS: every run_sql round is recorded in steps[], the last successful result becomes the display data (last)
